===Results===
The general election was held on November 8, 1994, and David Beasley was elected as the next [[governor of South Carolina]] in the closest election percentage wise since the disputed [[South Carolina gubernatorial election, 1876|election of 1876]]. [[Voter turnout|Turnout]] was higher than the previous gubernatorial election because of the competitive nature of the race between the two parties.

